<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronics for Imaging.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronics for Imaging.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Ted Kundtz initiated coverage of Electronics for Imaging Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set earnings per share estimates at $1.65 for 1997 and $2.15 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Kundtz said believes shares can reach $53-$55 in a year's time.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-3/4 at 39-3/4.</p>
</text>
